<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Jason-Wukong 的公开项目" />
    <title>PROJECT · 我的图书馆</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <nav aria-label="主导航">
        <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}>HOME</a>
        <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "")}/project/`} aria-current="page">PROJECT</a>
        <span>NOTE</span>
        <span>ONE MORE THING...</span>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <p class="eyebrow">SELECTED WORK / 01</p>
      <h1>PROJECT</h1>
      <p class="intro">从一个可以持续生长的个人网站开始。</p>

      <article>
        <div class="project-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="number">01 / WEB</p>
            <h2>Personal Wiki</h2>
          </div>
          <span class="status">已上线 · 持续建设</span>
        </div>
        <p class="description">
          一个用来展示作品与想法的个人空间。第一版完成了首页、可在自己的浏览器中更换的背景，以及公开发布；其他栏目会随着真实内容逐步开放。
        </p>
        <p class="technology">Astro · CSS · GitHub Pages</p>
        <div class="project-links">
          <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}>浏览网站 ↗</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/Jason-Wukong/personal-wiki">查看源码 ↗</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <span>Jason-Wukong</span>
      <a href="https://github.com/Jason-Wukong">GitHub ↗</a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: #f7f7f5;
    color: #202020;
    font-family: Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
  }

  nav, main, footer {
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: 40px;
    padding-right: 40px;
  }

  nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
  }

  nav a, footer a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  nav a[aria-current="page"] {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  nav a:not([aria-current]) {
    color: #777;
  }

  nav span, .eyebrow, .number, .technology, footer {
    color: #777;
  }

  main {
    padding-top: 88px;
    padding-bottom: 112px;
  }

  .eyebrow, .number, .technology {
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 12px 0 18px;
    font-size: clamp(56px, 9vw, 96px);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .intro {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  article {
    margin-top: 80px;
    padding: 40px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: #eceef1;
  }

  .project-heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .number { margin: 0 0 12px; }

  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 48px);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .status { color: #555; }

  .description {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 32px 0;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .technology { margin: 0; }

  .project-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .project-links a {
    color: inherit;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-bottom: 48px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    nav {
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    nav, main, footer {
      padding-left: 24px;
      padding-right: 24px;
    }

    main { padding-top: 64px; padding-bottom: 72px; }
    article { margin-top: 56px; padding: 28px; }
    .project-heading { display: block; }
    .status { display: inline-block; margin-top: 16px; }
    .project-links { flex-wrap: wrap; }
  }
